   "description": "Peggy feels like a familiar memory, and Pearl is a beautiful deja vu. A compact square case frames a layered dial with a Mother of Pearl radial center, a charcoal outer field, and bright white accents that create a quiet sense of tension and balance. Designed as a companion to Cool Eddie, the 28mm Peggy captures the same feeling of something cherished, worn, and remembered. Its smaller proportions recall the understated elegance of vintage watches made to be lived with every day. This is the first edition of The Peggy. Designed by Madison Hudson, limited to 100 pieces. Available with a stainless steel linked bracelet band with a butterfly clasp. The Peggy Watch Movement: Miyota Quartz Case: Stainless Steel Case: 28 x 28 mm Lug-to-lug: 36 mm Case Depth: 7.25 mm Crystal: Mineral Strap / Buckle: Stainless Steel Linked Bracelet, 16 mm Water Resistant: 3ATM",
