   "description": "Eddie feels like family history, and Cool Eddie is like family folklore. A unique square case frames a layered dial, a deep and dark green center with a radial finish, a cream outer field, and fine neon accents that add some loud tension. Named after Grandpa Eddie, and inspired by a watch his kids remember him wearing in the early ’80s, Eddie carries the feeling of something familiar and dependable. This is the second color exploration of The Eddie. Designed by Madison Hudson, this colorway is limited to 100 pieces. Available with a stainless steel bracelet band, with more band options to come later this fall. The Eddie Watch Movement: Miyota Quartz Case: Stainless Steel Case: 34 x 34 mm Lug-to-lug: 42mm Case Depth: 8 mm Crystal: Mineral Strap / Buckle: 20 mm, Stainless Steel Linked Bracelet Band Water Resistant: 3ATM",
