   "priceMinor": 25000,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "*Excluded from sale.* This is the latest development of the Broken Time concept. Coming in an off-white \"bone\" color way, still at 40mm, on an alternative leather strap made out of apple cores. The broken-ness is refined. The band is unbelievably comfortable. The first run is limited to 100 pieces. At first glance, Broken Time is a flashy watch, that's been smashed by a tiny hammer. On closer look, you notice that the broken details in the design are what makes the watch special. The numbers on the face? A distraction. The hour and minute hands? Are actually the second hand. The cracked glass? Fully intact. The chronograph hand? It's just hanging out. If you want to know the time, just look to the broken windows, and they'll tell you exactly what you need to know. This is Brad's second of many watches with Mad Hudson. Broken Time Movement: Miyota Quartz Case: Stainless steel Case Diameter: 40 mm Case Depth: 8.85 mm Crystal: Mineral Strap / Buckle: Alternative leather made from apple cores. 18mm at the connection point, 22mm wide Water Resistant: 3ATM",
