   "description": "Our stock of the Pride Watch is sold out. The artist still has limited supply available at artisanhue.com Created by Alex Donahue and recently revived with a handful of thoughtful updates, this loved design returns in an extremely limited run. From The Artist: “This time-piece is dedicated to those individuals who have bravely stood with pride for the rights of all people. The watch features 6 colors which continually move about the watch. Twice a day, at both noon and midnight, the colors come together to create the shape of a rainbow. This formation is a powerful reminder that when people of varied backgrounds and interests come together, beautiful things can happen.”",
